MM, pets + daggers is all you need for offense. For defense, you want
poison resistance and a negative AC and a wand of teleport or digging
or fire. That's what you should focus on.

Try out armor, even metallic non-body armor and small shields (MM gets
a spellcasting bonus). Mithril armor can also give you good AC but
you'll lose your fighting spells (MM). Eat PR-granting corpses,
acquire a unihorn to broaden your PR-granting diet.

You don't need Magicbane. At this point, it'll be useless for offense.
It is a useful late-game defense token, but you're not there yet.

An angry priest is *dangerous*. Even more when invisible. There will
be other altars (there's one in the Quest). Drop it.

